  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>Returns a string that is the current date in the UTC time zone in the format &quot;YYYY-MM-DD&quot;.</p>
  <p>If you wish to know the time as well use: <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/LlGetTimestamp" target="_blank">llGetTimestamp</a> which uses the format &quot;YYYY-MM-DDThh:mm:ss.ff..fZ&quot;</p>
</p>
    </div>

